    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      266.45,
      401.9,
      290.87
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      305.69,
      401.86,
      330.11
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Safeguard Measures(Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      345.05,
      401.92,
      448.07
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 2 of the Safeguard Measures Act, No. 3 of 2018,(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended in subsection (1) thereof, by the substitution forthe words \u201cthe Director General of Commerce (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cDirector General\u201d)\u201d, of the words \u201cSecretaryto the Ministry of the Minister assigned the subject ofInternational Trade (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cSecretary\u201d),\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      462.89,
      401.9,
      539.75
    ],
    "text": "3. The principal enactment is hereby amended by thesubstitution for the words \u201cDirector General\u201d wherever thosewords occur in the principal enactment, notice, notification,contract, communication or other document, of the words\u201cSecretary to the Ministry of the Minister assigned the subjectof International Trade\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      593.93,
      401.89,
      618.35
    ],
    "text": "4. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
